      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Pop-gtk-theme</title>

    <para>Prepare Pop-gtk-theme for compilation:</para>

      <para>Patch a vulnerability, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="pre">patch -Np1 -i ../&pop-gtk-theme-patch;</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Configure the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">meson setup Ybuild --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
            -D icons=true -D gnome-shell=true \
            -D gnome-shell-gresource=true     \
            -D gtk4=true -D sounds=true       \
            -D sessions=true -D default=true  \
            -D dark=true -D light=true</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>
        <screen><userinput remap="make">ninja -C Ybuild</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>
        <screen><userinput remap="install">ninja -C Ybuild install</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

